NPCs: {
	GroundedHarpyNPC: {
		DisplayName: Grounded Harpy

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I'd rather be in the sky again!
			NoHome: If you're keeping me down here with you, at least house me! Scraw!
			FarFromHome: I flew too far in my exercises!
			LoveSpace: Less humans to bug me! Caw!
			DislikeCrowded: Please make these humans stop cooing!
			HateCrowded: Scree! Personal bubble!
			HateBiome: I can't fly in this cave! I'll bonk my head on the ceiling!
			LoveNPC: "{NPCName} Understands me in a way I feel no human could!"
			LikeNPC: "{NPCName} offered to build me cog wings!"
			DislikeNPC: UwU
			HateNPC: Scraw! That {NPCName} painted me fat!
			LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is my favorite human! So cheerful and fun!"
			Princess_LovesNPC: I didn't know harpies like {NPCName} could be so kind!
			LikeBiome: I can see the sky here... I'll return one day!
			DislikeBiome: It's c-c-cold! I need to fly south for the winter!
		}

		Census.SpawnCondition: Use {$Items.PowderedSugar.DisplayName} [i:WgMod/PowderedSugar] on a harpy
	}

	HomingFood.DisplayName: Cursed Food

	MilkmaidNPC: {
		DisplayName: Milkmaid

		TownNPCMood: {
			Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so big and soft!"
			LikeNPC_Princess: That {NPCName} is a precious lil' lady.
			HateNPC: Tell {NPCName} that if he comes knockin' again, I'm getting the gun.
			LikeNPC: "{NPCName} and I have a good business relationship."
			LoveNPC: "{NPCName} provides a real service, not many people can say that these days."
			DislikeNPC: Every time I see {NPCName} she criticizes my hair. I'd like to see her keep up that hairdo on the ranch.
			HateBiome: It's too damn hot in the {BiomeName}! No good for crops or animals!
			DislikeBiome: How do ya expect me to grow crop beside the {BiomeName}?
			LikeBiome: It's chilly in the {BiomeName}, bovines like me are plump y'know.
			LoveBiome: Ah, the {BiomeName}... not ideal, but the best place to start a farm on this island.
			HateCrowded: I already have a hard time fittin' through these doors, how do ya think it goes with all these folks?
			DislikeCrowded: This much crowding ain't good for crop, get 'em out.
			LoveSpace: Wide pastures, ideal fer a big cow like me!
			FarFromHome: Y'ever heard that phrase about the cows comin' home? Well I don't think this cow is tonight...
			NoHome: What's a cow without a barn? Nothin', that's what.
			Content: I ain't complainin'.
		}

		Census.SpawnCondition: Reach a weight of at least Fat
	}

	SweetSpirit.DisplayName: Sweet Spirit

	OverflowingMimicNPC: {
		TownNPCMood: {
			HateNPC: Taxman take gold coins! Evil! Full of malice!
			LikeNPC: Like bomb guy! Throw bombs! Boom!
			DislikeNPC: Mean and evil plunderer, tried to reach and find treasure! All plunderer found was flabby!
			DislikeBiome: It's too pretty up here! Don't like it one bit!
			LikeBiome: Cozy cold home, comfy and nice!
			LoveBiome: We most comfy in the caves! Yay!
			HateCrowded: Too many others around... no good!
			DislikeCrowded: Needs personal space!
			LoveSpace: Human built good spacious chest!
			FarFromHome: Help! Got lost!
			NoHome: Need comfy chest to live in!
			Content: Happy!
			LikeNPC_Princess: Pink girl give tasty loot!
			Princess_LovesNPC: I've never seen a mimic like {NPCName} in person before! She's so pretty!
		}

		DisplayName: Overflowing Mimic
		Census.SpawnCondition: Use {$Items.PowderedSugar.DisplayName} [i:WgMod/PowderedSugar] on a mimic
	}
}

Dialogue: {
	GroundedHarpy: {
		StandardDialogue1: Scraw! I'm still mad at you for making me this big!
		StandardDialogue2: No wonder humans can't fly if all of their food tastes this good!
		StandardDialogue3: What? No we don't die when you kill us! We respawn, just like you! Scraw!
		StandardDialogue4: Have any more of that sweet powder stuff? Why? Mind your business!
		StandardDialogue5: Living on the ground is boring, I wanna touch the clouds again!
		StandardDialogue6: You've killed some big baddies, did you roast their meat by the fire?
		StandardDialogue7: No, we didn't build those sky houses! That's a harmful stereotype, scraw!
		StandardDialogue8: Can you groom my plumage? I've had a hard time doing it myself since... you know!
		DayDialogue1: You're interrupting my exercises! I will fly again soon!
		PartyDialogue1: Human festivities are so fun! And tasty!
		PartyDialogue2: Please tell {0} not to pin the tail on the harpy!
		WindyDayDialogue1: I feel like the wind's gonna take me away!
		WindyDayDialogue2: Screech! I flew! Did you see? What? It was just the wind?
		BloodMoonDialogue1: Come any closer and I'll use my talons! Craw!
		BloodMoonDialogue2: SCRAW! BACK OFF!
		BloodMoonDialogue3: Huff! Huff! Must lose weight! Scree!
		HomelessDialogue1: Human! House me immediately!
		HomelessDialogue2: You did this to me, you take responsibility!
		HomelessDialogue3: Huff... huff... I need somewhere to rest...
		HardModeDialogue1: I never liked those long dragons... they think harpies are food!
		RainDialogue1: Screech! I can't work out in these conditions!
		RainDialogue2: I guess I'll stay home and eat today...
		RainDialogue3: Today's just a cheat day! What? I'm not over my weekly limit!
		StormDialogue1: SCRAW! PANIC! SCRAW!
		SlimeRainDialogue1: How do you think slimes taste?
		LoveStruckDialogue1: Human... you look tastier than usual...
		EvilBossDialogue1: Scraw! I took the liberty to turn that big evil baddie into food for you! Scraw!
		SkeletronDialogue1: I'd love to make you a traditional harpy stormbow, but I'd need some really big bones to do it!
		SkeletronDialogue2: Caw! That skull baddie you killed was perfect for crafting a traditional harpy stormbow!
		QuestFishDialogue1: No, I won't carry you up to the sky lakes for your fish!
		CatDialogue1: Hey... can I watch {0} today? No reason! It just looks so yummy- I mean cute!
		DogDialogue1: "{0} barks at me all the time! I'm not a bird!"
	}

	Milkmaid: {
		StandardDialogue1: I heard there was a hero here who couldn't keep their weight in check. I suppose that's you, doll?
		StandardDialogue2: My breasts produce some unique concoctions. One sip'll have ya bedbound or a string bean.
		StandardDialogue3: Ya need some milk? I'm yer gal.
		StandardDialogue4: Yer a pretty little thing, could use some weight though.
		StandardDialogue5: How'd I get this big? Let's see... now was it the custard machine or the feeder cult?
		StandardDialogue6: People look at my horns n' think I'm a man. They never heard of a butch.
		StandardDialogue7: Y'know, all the dang monstrosities ya see 'round here, where're all the animals?
		StandardDialogue8: My damn overalls, they keep shrinkin' or somethin'.
		BloodMoonDialogue1: Hmph.
		BloodMoonDialogue2: Yer face ain't as endearing as it usually is, back up.
		BloodMoonDialogue3: Not enough milk for ya? Too bad.
		HomelessDialogue1: Have ya got a spare barn I can crash in?
		HomelessDialogue2: Yer a hero, save a little farm gal and give her some cheap property.
		HomelessDialogue3: I ain't sure if this land is good fer crops, but with how plump the ladies get it's gonna be great fer animals.
		ArmsDealerDialogue1: Ya'd think {0} would get off my back when I told 'im I was a lesbian, he started talkin' to {1} about hormone replacement.
		DryadDialogue1: I offered {0} an apple from one a' my trees, she looked at me like my fat's contagious.
		MechanicDialogue1: "{0} told me she could build a machine to care fer my crops fer me, I told 'er they wouldn't be my crops if I didn't do it myself."
		PartyDialogue1: Hey, the frosting on the cake? Yer welcome.
		StormDialogue1: Jeez, I sure hope my cattle got home safe...
		StormDialogue2: Whatever god's in charge a the weather, she ain't too joyful.
		RainDialogue1: A lil' rain is good fer the crops, don't mean I gotta like it myself.
		RainDialogue2: When I was young, ma always told me not to drink the raindrops.
		WindyDayDialogue1: Ahh, the sound of the weather vane always reminds me of better times...
		WindyDayDialogue2: Sometimes I like to lay down in a field and feel the wind blow... 's hard to get up afterwards, though.
		DayDialogue1: Huff, huff... phew! Sun's cookin' me today!
		DayDialogue2: Babydoll, can ya get me somethin' cold to drink? Er, maybe a few things?
		LoveStruckDialogue1: Mroo~ Why don't ya come meet me behind my barn, hun~?
		LoveStruckDialogue2: Mmph... I think I'm in heat all of a sudden... Can ya give me some alone time?
		Milked1: Mrooo~
		Milked2: Hrmph... yer too gentle.
		Milked3: Uhf, that's it? Dang...
		MilkedDeny: Come back tomorrow, hun.
		BloodMilked1: Hrmph. Off me.
		BloodMilked2: BACK OFF!
		BloodMilked3: Next time I'm kickin'.
		BloodMilkedDeny: Ya already had yer fill, beat it hoss.
	}

	OverflowingMimic: {
		StandardDialogue1: Why make {0} big, human? Mean human! Bad!
		StandardDialogue2: Bwah! Don't look at {0}'s belly!
		StandardDialogue3: Slime like {0} can ride chest! Look like loot!
		StandardDialogue4: Your name {1}? That name silly! {0} name better!
		StandardDialogue5: "{0} chest is getting so heavy to bounce around in... human fault!"
		StandardDialogue6: Hungry... {1}! Give {0} food! Now!
		StandardDialogue7: Could {1} uhmm... teach {0} how doors work again?
		StandardDialogue8: Uuurrp... {0} found a little bunny... so yummy!
		BloodMoonDialogue1: GRAHAHA! THE MOON HUNGRY TONIGHT!
		BloodMoonDialogue2: EAT EVERYTHING! EAT EVERYONE!
		BloodMoonDialogue3: OOUUURRRPP...
		HomelessDialogue1: Mean human! Give {0} a home!
		HomelessDialogue2: Can human make {0} really really big chest?
		HomelessDialogue3: "{0} too fat for chest now! Oh no!"
		PartyDialogue1: "{0} tried to take a nap and humans put cups on top of {0}! So rude!"
		PartyDialogue2: Woo woo woo! Dance dance!
		StormDialogue1: Human, help! There giant loud monster outside!
		StormDialogue2: AH! RUN AWAY!
		RainDialogue1: Rain rain, go away...
		RainDialogue2: "{0} so boooooored... wants to play outside!"
		RainDialogue3: Does {1} know spell to stop rain?
		WindyDayDialogue1: Sky try to steal {0}, but {0} too heavy!
		WindyDayDialogue2: "{0} watch the plants dance all day... so pretty..."
		DayDialogue1: Pretty day! Full of play!
		NightDialogue1: "{0} love nighttime, so many friends out to play!"
		LoveStruckDialogue1: "{1}... {0} kinda wants to... bite {1} face..."
		PostMechDialogue1: "{0} ate the flesh of big robots... {0} feels so powerful..."
	}
}

Bestiary: {
	GroundedHarpy: A previously free and carefree harpy, fattened until she cannot fly! She will begrudgingly provide you with useful materials from the sky.
	Milkmaid: Simple and kind cowgirl, her magical teats produce milkshakes that can instantly change the drinker's weight! Regularly attends lesbian bars.
	OverflowingMimic: Mimics are a form of slime who act much like hermit crabs, moving from chest to chest as they grow. This one may be a bit big for her chest, though...
	HomingFood: Food cursed by a malevolent spirit to seek out and fatten up adventurers until they're defenseless.
	SweetSpirit: These spirits that dwell in the caverns will try their best to fatten you up.
}

